<title>USA: FREE-TO-TRADE - Monroe Cty, N.Y., $150 mln GOs.</title>
<headline>FREE-TO-TRADE - Monroe Cty, N.Y., $150 mln GOs.</headline>
<text>
<p>COUNTY OF MONROE, NEW YORK</p>
<p>RE: $150,155,000</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION BONDS</p>
<p>Effective at 2:30 P.M. E.S.T., Thursday, November 21, 1996</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
<p>and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>First Albany Corporation</p>
<p>Artemis Capital Group, Inc.</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>Pryor, McClendon, Counts &amp; Co., Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
